 "none"}, {"name": "foot locker, inc.", "sentiment": "none"}, {"name": "nsp", "sentiment": "none"}, {"name": "nike inc", "sentiment": "none"}]}, "highlightText": "", "language": "english", "persons": [], "text": "Jim Cramer said on CNBC's \"Mad Money Lightning Round\" he likes Johnson & Johnson (NYSE: JNJ ).\nPure Storage Inc (NYSE: PSTG ) is a buy, thinks Cramer. He added that the company has a very smart management.\nCramer isn't a buyer of Frontline Ltd (NYSE: FRO ). He has never liked the very large crude carriers.\nGulfport Energy Corporation (NASDAQ: GPOR ) isn't high enough quality for Cramer. He thinks the stock is way down in the food chain. He would buy Schlumberger Limited. (NYSE: SLB ) instead.\nCramer isn't willing to recommend the components players that go into Apple (NASDAQ: AAPL ). He isn't a buyer of Cirrus Logic, Inc. (NASDAQ: CRUS ).\nFoot Locker, Inc. (NYSE: FL ) is all right, said Cramer. He prefers Nike Inc (NYSE: NKE ).\nCramer thinks Insperity Inc (NYSE: NSP ) is a buy. He has been recommending it for ages.\nCramer isn't a buyer of Preferred Apartment Communities, Inc. (NYSE: APTS ). He sees the 7 percent yield as a red flag and he doesn't like multi-family segment.\n ", "external_links": ["http://www.benzinga.com/stock/crus#NASDAQ", "http://www.benzinga.com/stock/nke#NYSE", "http://www.benzinga.com/stock/gpor#NASDAQ", "http://www.benzinga.com/stock/nsp#NYSE", "http://www.benzinga.com/stock/aapl#NASDAQ", "http://www.benzinga.com/stock/apts#NYSE", "http://www.benzinga.com/stock/pstg#NYSE", "https://www.cnbc.com/video/2018/05/16/cramers-lightning-round-dont-buy-apple-suppliers-right-now.html", "http://www.benzinga.com/stock/fl#NYSE", "http://www.benzinga.com/stock/jnj#NYSE", "http://www.benzinga.com/stock/fro#NYSE", "http://www.addthis.com/bookmark.php?v=250", "http://www.benzinga.com/stock/slb#NYSE"], "published": "2018-05-17T03:00:00.000+03:00", "crawled": "2018-05-17T16:13:02.022+03:00", "highlightTitle": ""}